// Fairfield County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Auditor's Pivot Point
// site, the Board of Elections, the ESC homepage, the Eagle-Gazette and the
// Wahkeena preserve page) were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * Fairfield Medical Center is now Adena Fairfield Medical Center after Adena
//     Health's acquisition (fmchealth.org still works).
//   * The Auditor launched a new Pivot Point property site,
//     auditorrealestate.fairfieldcountyohio.gov; the old Schneider site
//     (realestate.co.fairfield.oh.us) is the fallback while it is finished.
//   * The generic OhioMeansJobs homepage was replaced with Fairfield County JFS's
//     own OhioMeansJobs center page.
//   * Pickerington and Fairfield Union schools moved to plsd.us and
//     fairfieldunion.org; Lancaster city moved to lancasterohio.gov.
//   * New Horizons Mental Health Services is stopping operations; clients are sent
//     to OhioGuidestone (STARLight Center).
//
// TRAPS
//
//   The CITY of Fairfield, Ohio is in Butler County. Also Fairfield County CT/SC,
//   Fairfield CA/IA, Lancaster PA/CA/NY, Baltimore MD. stbernschool.org is a
//   Virginia school, not St. Bernadette in Lancaster. columbusmessenger.com (the
//   Southeast Messenger) redirects to an unrelated site.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Cities: Lancaster (seat), Pickerington (partly Franklin) and Canal Winchester
//     (mostly Franklin; on the county's own list). Reynoldsburg and Columbus reach
//     in slightly and are left out.
//   * Villages with sites: Amanda, Baltimore, Bremen, Carroll, Lithopolis,
//     Millersport, Pleasantville, Sugar Grove, Thurston. Rushville, West Rushville
//     and Stoutsville have none. Basil merged into Baltimore.
//   * Eight county-based school districts; Canal Winchester, Northern,
//     Reynoldsburg, Southwest Licking and Teays Valley reach in from outside.
//     Eastland-Fairfield Career & Technical Schools is headquartered in Groveport.
//   * Diley Ridge Medical Center (Canal Winchester address) sits in northwest
//     Fairfield County. Buckeye Lake spans Fairfield, Licking and Perry.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * WLOH and WLRY radio: both sites fail with a certificate error.
//   * Land bank: exists in state audit reports, no website.
//   * Shallenberger and Christmas Rocks nature preserves: no ODNR page found.

